ent-BannerCommandItem = command banner
    .desc = A war banner of the detachment. Whoever holds it can give one command, and those standing nearby will hear it.

ent-ActionBannerOffense = Offense
    .desc = Command an advance. Everyone nearby moves faster for a minute.

ent-ActionBannerDefense = Staunch defense
    .desc = Command a staunch defense. Everyone nearby gains 25% resistance to damage for a minute.

ent-ActionBannerConcentrateFire = Concentrate fire
    .desc = Command everyone to concentrate fire. Weapons nearby fire faster and more accurately for 30 seconds.

ent-StatusEffectBannerOffense = offense inspiration

banner-offense-effect-examine = [color=yellow]Inspired by the advance — moving faster.[/color]

action-speech-banner-offense = Forward, on me!
action-speech-banner-defense = Not a step back!
action-speech-banner-concentrate = Concentrate fire!
